WEBVTT

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:32.281
and the United Nations headquarters.

00:00:32.281 --> 00:00:34.004
Thankfully, those plans were foiled

00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:36.841
by an FBI informant.

00:00:36.841 --> 00:00:39.397
Sadly, the 1993 bombing

00:00:39.397 --> 00:00:42.578
of the World Trade Center was not.

00:00:42.578 --> 00:00:44.317
Nosair would eventually be convicted

00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:47.741
for his involvement in the plot.

00:00:47.741 --> 00:00:51.988
El-Sayyid Nosair is my father.

00:00:51.988 --> 00:00:53.898
I was born in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania

00:00:53.898 --> 00:00:57.622
in 1983 to him, an Egyptian engineer,

00:00:57.622 --> 00:01:00.817
and a loving American mother
and grade school teacher,